.hypothesis/

### Vale ###
# `vale sync` downloads the styles named by `Packages` in .vale.ini into
# StylesPath. Only the project vocabulary under .vale/config is tracked.
/.vale/*
!/.vale/config/
/.vale/config/*
!/.vale/config/vocabularies/
# The repo's own style, alongside the downloaded packages.
!/.vale/ucgmsim/

